  "details": "Change into an avatar with an animation driven by EyeHeightAsMeters.  Change your height.  Swap out to another avatar, swap back.  For anyone seeing the avatar for the first time, they will see the avatar as the maximum height value animation.\n\nCan be tested with my avatar avtr_97c6bdac-3ad6-4a89-bca9-35b6d25a7c76\n\nMinimum height should appear to be in a cup.  However on-load, other players will see the \"fully-grown\" form instead scaled down.",
